# Live singles

Only matches **currently in play**. Stake as **singles**. Never a live accumulator.

Read **`live-fixtures.md`** for source URLs and verification checklist.

## Live discovery (required)

1. **ESPN API snapshot** — injected in web app prompts (`/api/live/fixtures`).
2. **Cross-check every candidate** on:
   - [LiveScore live hub](https://www.livescore.com/en/football/live/)
   - [FlashScore](https://www.flashscore.com/)
   - [Sofascore](https://www.sofascore.com/) — preferred for **xG, shots, corners, cards**
   - [FotMob live](https://www.fotmob.com/live) — backup stats
3. Copy the remaining/match line from the priced market board when it is there. **No board quote does not block publishing** — set `price_available: false`, omit `odds`, note in reasoning.

If ESPN shows zero games, still scan LiveScore/FlashScore/Sofascore — do not assume the slate is empty.

## What to record per checked match

League, match, **minute**, **score**, shots/xG/corners if available, live price or "no price", verdict (pick candidate / skip + why).

Output however many picks pass the confidence gate (often **0**). Populate `skipped[]` for every in-play game reviewed.

## Live markets (all allowed when evidenced)

- No more goals / Under remaining — sit-in, 2-0 after 70', 0-0 no chances
- Over/under remaining or match
- Double chance, DNB, Asian handicap
- Corners O/U — name the line
- Team over 0.5 remaining / next goal

## Typical patterns

- 0-0 after 55' **with chances** → remaining over / next goal
- 0-0 **no chances** → no more goals / remaining under
- Favourite 0-1 with xG lead → team over remaining, DNB, DC
- 2-0+ after 75' → no more goals / under remaining
- Skip after 88' unless 6+ added minutes

**No board price = still publish** (set `price_available: false`, no odds). **Before 55' on 0-0 with no chances = skip** unless a clear live edge exists.

Web app: `scope: live`. Chat save: `_live.md`.
